      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: This shows you how to modify the <color=#0FF>Press3D</color> demo scene to make a control system where you can pick up, spin, and throw Rigidbody GameObjects. The cubes are initially marked as <color=#0FF>Kinematic</color>, and this is disabled from the <color=#0FF>LeanSelectable.OnSelect</color> event. Once selected, the <color=#0FF>LeanSelectableDragTorque</color> and <color=#0FF>LeanDragTranslateRigidbody</color> components allow for control. The <color=#0FF>LeanSelectable.OnDeselect</color> event can then be used to disable the <color=#0FF>LeanSelectable</color> component, preventing any further selection.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
